This repository contains the software for the GC–EI Annotation Reliability Tool.

The public EI/Kovats-RI spectral library used for method development and validation is not redistributed here.

Source dataset:

Tsugawa H. `msdial_eimslib_kovatsri`. Zenodo. DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.21910638.

